            <ui:Label text="so like.. you move with wasd or the arrow keys but you surely already knew that. and likeuhhhhh... you look around with mouse, you know. and then just walk up to the mushrooms to eat them and sheeeet like that, once big you cant jump or whatever. you can push stuff though, just walk into them. and like if you need to become small faster because you are a speedrunner, just press f. and you can also jump as small mouse with space... go figure.. &#10;&#10;GET THE CHEEESE NOWWWWWW " style="-unity-text-align: middle-center; position: absolute; top: 195px; left: 863px; height: 665px; width: 887px; -unity-font-definition: url(&quot;project://database/Assets/Fonts/Spicy%20Sale.ttf?fileID=12800000&amp;guid=71db7e7139864d8499eb356a1aba552d&amp;type=3#Spicy Sale&quot;); font-size: 34px; white-space: pre-wrap;"/>
